### n8n Customer Support Workflow Tests
### Usage: You can use the "REST Client" extension in VS Code to run these directly,
### or import this format into Postman/Insomnia.

@webhook_url = your_webhook_url
@api_key = your_api_key


### 1. Valid High Priority Ticket (Should trigger Telegram & Sheet)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "merna h",
    "email": "Mernfgny@example.com",
    "priority": "High",
    "subject": "System completely down",
    "message": "I cannot log in and my entire team is blocked."
}


### 2. Valid Medium Priority Ticket (Should trigger Sheet only)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "Sarh Smith",
    "email": "sarahsmith@example.com",
    "priority": "Medium",
    "subject": "Billing Question",
    "message": "Can you help me understand the charges on my latest invoice?"
}


### 3. Valid Low Priority Ticket (Should trigger Sheet only)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "priority": "Low",
    "subject": "Feature Request",
    "message": "It would be great if you could add a dark mode to the dashboard."
}


### 4. Duplicate Ticket Test (Run this twice - the second time should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "Duplicate Tester",
    "email": "tester@example.com",
    "priority": "High",
    "subject": "Testing Duplicates",
    "message": "This is a test for the duplicate detection system."
}


### 5. Validation Error: Missing Required Field (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "Missing Data",
    "priority": "High",
    "message": "I forgot to include my email and subject."
}


### 6. Validation Error: Invalid Email Format (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "Bad Email",
    "email": "this-is-not-an-email",
    "priority": "Medium",
    "subject": "Invalid Email Test",
    "message": "Testing the regex validation."
}


### 7. Validation Error: Invalid Priority (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{webhook_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "customer_name": "Wrong Priority",
    "email": "priority@example.com",
    "priority": "Critical", 
    "subject": "Invalid Priority Test",
    "message": "Priority must be High, Medium, or Low. Critical should fail."
}
